            "explanation": "Positive present 'to be' → negative tag. Cats and dogs ARE the most popular pets, AREN'T they? POSITIVE → NEGATIVE. ARE → AREN'T. Plural subject → aren't. Cats and dogs ARE the most popular pets, AREN'T they? Positive → Negative. ARE → AREN'T they."
