            "passage": "Last December, my family went on a trip to Cameron Highlands. We left home (1)________ six o'clock in the morning. (2)________ the journey, we drove (3)________ a long tunnel in the mountains. We arrived (4)________ noon and checked into our hotel. (5)________ the afternoon, we visited a strawberry farm. We had to wear jackets (6)________ the visit because it was very cold there. (7)________ dinner, we sat by the fire and drank hot chocolate. We had to leave (8)________ Saturday morning because Father had to return to work.",
