            "sentence": "The library was very quiet ________ many children were reading silently at their tables.",
            "options": [
              "so",
              "but",
              "when",
              "because"
            ],
            "answer": 2,
            "explanation": "The library was quiet WHEN children were reading = the quietness and the reading happened at the same time. WHEN connects two simultaneous events."
