            "passage": "Lily enjoys (1)________ her two goldfish every morning before school. She (2)________ them exactly the right amount each time so they stay healthy. Last week, she (3)________ them a little too much and the water turned cloudy. While she (4)________ them one morning, she noticed one fish was not moving. Her younger brothers (5)________ the family rabbit in the garden at the same time, so she called out to her mother for help. The vet reminded Lily (6)________ her fish only once a day from then on. She says we should never (7)________ pet fish more than they need, as overfeeding can harm them. Right now, Lily (8)________ her fish carefully, making sure she gives them just the right amount.",
