            "id": "S30_A_S30_A2",
            "topic": "VocabMCQ",
            "sentence": "The dragon's roar echoed through the valley, as ________ as rolling thunder across a stormy sky.",
            "options": [
              "quiet",
              "soft",
              "loud",
              "swift"
            ],
            "answer": 2,
            "explanation": "AS + adj + AS = Simile! The dragon's roar was AS LOUD AS rolling thunder = comparing its sound to a thunderstorm. Similes always use 'as ... as' to compare two different things directly."
